# label: alg:ch77-decode
# pseudocode source: chapters/ch77.tex:81
# caption: Decode bytes while recording original scalar boundaries.

REQUIRE byte buffer with known extent; strict UTF-8 policy
ENSURE scalar sequence and byte-offset map, or first malformed-byte diagnostic
p <- 0; initialize output and offset map
WHILE p is before the end DO
  classify leading byte and required sequence length
  check extent and continuation-byte shapes before reading them
  reconstruct value; reject overlong, surrogate, or out-of-range values
  append scalar and its original byte offset; advance by sequence length
END WHILE
append final byte extent to the boundary map

